  "source_code": "mod  = 998244353\r\nt = int(input())\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    a = list(map(int, input().split()))\r\n    h = [0]*n\r\n    for i in range(1,n):\r\n        h[i] = (h[i-1] + pow(i,mod-2, mod))\r\n    ans = 0 \r\n    for i in range(n):\r\n            coef = (h[i]+h[n-1-i])% mod\r\n            ans = (ans+a[i]*coef)% mod\r\n    print(ans)",
